         fhir:equivalence [ fhir:v "equivalent" ] ;
         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Observation.interpretation` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Observation.interpretation` as `Equivalent`.\nHistorically used for laboratory results (known as 'abnormal flag' ),  its use extends to other use cases where coded interpretations  are relevant.  Often reported as one or more simple compact codes this element is often placed adjacent to the result value in reports and flow sheets to signal the meaning/normalcy status of the result." ]
       ] )
